.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Representation of distribution metadata\&.

Compared to :class:`RawMetadata`, this class provides objects representing
metadata fields instead of only using built-in types\&. Any invalid metadata
will cause :exc:`InvalidMetadata` to be raised (with a
:py:attr:`~BaseException\&.__cause__` attribute as appropriate)\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS " \fBMetadata\fP packaging\&.metadata\&.Metadata\&.from_email ( cls, bytes | str data, *bool  validate = \fCTrue\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Parse metadata from email headers\&.

If *validate* is true, the metadata will be validated\&. All exceptions
related to validation will be gathered and raised as an :class:`ExceptionGroup`\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " \fBMetadata\fP packaging\&.metadata\&.Metadata\&.from_raw ( cls, \fBRawMetadata\fP data, *bool  validate = \fCTrue\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Create an instance from :class:`RawMetadata`\&.

If *validate* is true, all metadata will be validated\&. All exceptions
related to validation will be gathered and raised as an :class:`ExceptionGroup`\&.

.fi
.PP
 
